Houston, Ilana Glazer’s “Human Magic” on Hulu is just the start. Known for her candid, energetic performances, Ilana brings stories about urban life and feminism to the stage. Her comedy is like catching up with a friend who's been everywhere. You’ll feel every moment. 713 Music Hall · Tuesday, June 23, 2026. Link in bio for tickets. Tag someone you'd bring. 

